          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports feeling really hopeless and helpless, asking 'what's the point' and feeling useless. Reports low mood, anhedonia, poor motivation, reduced energy, and poor concentration at work and home. Says this has been bad for ages and may have worsened over the last few weeks; timeline is vague."
